# Shell scripts run inside Linux containers (docker-entrypoint.sh) and must
# keep LF line endings regardless of a contributor's core.autocrlf setting —
# alpine's /bin/sh chokes on a CRLF shebang line ("no such file or
# directory") otherwise. Without this, a Windows checkout with
# core.autocrlf=true would silently corrupt these on `git add`.
*.sh text eol=lf
